.TH ABRAFLEXI-ZABBIX-DIGEST 1 "May 2026" "abraflexi-zabbix" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
abraflexi-zabbix-digest \- AbraFlexi business metrics for Zabbix monitoring
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B abraflexi-zabbix-digest
[\fIMETRIC\fR]
[\fB\-\-metric\fR=\fIMETRIC\fR]
[\fB\-\-env\fR=\fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-debug\fR]
[\fB\-\-color\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Collects business metrics from AbraFlexi accounting system using digest
modules and outputs them in a format suitable for Zabbix monitoring.
Results are cached for 5 minutes to reduce API load.
.PP
When called without arguments, outputs all metrics as a JSON object.
When a metric name is provided, outputs only that metric's value.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-metric=\fIMETRIC\fR
Return a single metric value. Can also be specified as a positional argument.
.TP
.B \-\-env=\fIFILE\fR
Path to .env configuration file (default: /etc/abraflexi-zabbix/.env).
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Pretty-print JSON output.
.TP
.B \-\-color
Colorize JSON output (implies debug).
.SH AVAILABLE METRICS
.TP
.B debtors.count
Number of debtors with overdue invoices.
.TP
.B debtors.total_amount
Total outstanding amount from debtors.
.TP
.B debtors.max_overdue_days
Maximum number of days overdue among all debtors.
.TP
.B waiting_income.count
Number of unpaid outcoming invoices.
.TP
.B waiting_income.total_amount
Total amount of unpaid outcoming invoices.
.TP
.B waiting_payments.count
Number of unpaid incoming invoices.
.TP
.B waiting_payments.total_amount
Total amount of unpaid incoming invoices.
.TP
.B unmatched_payments.count
Number of unmatched bank payments.
.TP
.B unmatched_payments.total_amount
Total amount of unmatched payments.
.TP
.B incoming_invoices.count
Number of incoming invoices in the period.
.TP
.B outcoming_invoices.count
Number of outcoming invoices in the period.
.TP
.B last_run
Unix timestamp of last data collection.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ABRAFLEXI_URL
AbraFlexi server URL.
.TP
.B ABRAFLEXI_LOGIN
API login username.
.TP
.B ABRAFLEXI_PASSWORD
API login password.
.TP
.B ABRAFLEXI_COMPANY
Company database name.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/cache/abraflexi-zabbix/digest_cache.json
Cached metrics data (5 minute TTL).
.TP
.I /etc/zabbix/zabbix_agent2.d/abraflexi-digest.conf
Zabbix agent UserParameter configuration.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR abraflexi-zabbix-status (1),
.BR abraflexi-zabbix-network (1),
.BR zabbix_agent2 (8)
